+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed under Routes in `README.md`.
+
+`POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "..." }` with columns
+`ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`. Each quantity is a positive whole number of
+dishes. It returns `{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }` with counts newly
+imported. Previously imported tickets are skipped; the file is atomic.
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array
+of `{ "itemId": 1, "theoretical": 0.3, "actual": 0.4, "difference": 0.1 }`.
+Days are inclusive in UTC; difference is actual minus theoretical.
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
